---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' https://forum.plantuml.net/20492
' Non-regression guard: remove followed by restore on the same tag must
' bring the label back exactly as if nothing had happened.
skinparam stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node

state Idle
state Charging
state Faulted $fault

Idle --> Charging : start
Charging --> Faulted : fault

remove $fault
restore $fault
@enduml
